-584c967455-zqhjs.jpeg"},{"s":1795300493,"e":1795303629,"t":"Episodio 103","d":"Bárbara amenaza a Marisela y acusa a Santos de traidor por ceder El Miedo a Marisela.","i":"https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_2654166803_1_20260312T214815391Z_80_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-584c967455-sqrdh.jpeg"},{"s":1795303629,"e":1795306765,"t":"Episodio 104","d":"Bárbara y Santos discuten. Antonio y Cecilia se aman, pero él decide irse lejos de El Progreso.","i":"https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_2660174795_0_20260314T080436384Z_70_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-584c967455-4jtsx.jpeg"}]